<title>SWEDEN: Swedish c/a surplus 0.9 bln SKR in Dec.</title>
<headline>Swedish c/a surplus 0.9 bln SKR in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's current account for December showed a surplus of 0.9 billion crowns, producing a surplus of 41.5 billion in the 12 months to that date, central bank (Riksbank) figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    SWEDISH CURRENT ACCOUNT	 Dec 96    Nov 96     Dec 95</p>
<p>    Monthly balance		   +0.9	+6.0	  -0.7</p>
<p>    Year/year			  +41.5     +39.9	 +35.3</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in billions of crowns. Average market expectations had been for a surplus of 2.1 billion crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
